<title>BULGARIA: BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR JUNE 2.</title>
<headline>BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR JUNE 2.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bulgarian National Bank set</p>
<p>the following fixed exchange rates against the Bulgarian lev</p>
<p>for Monday, June 2:</p>
<p>(Previous in brackets)</p>
<p>    USD  1,568.80 (1,568.10)	CHF  1,111.40 (1,108.20)</p>
<p>    DEM    922.06 (921.54)	  GBP  2,568.80 (2,568.90)</p>
<p>    ATS    131.01 (130.88)</p>
<p>Trading volume for Friday (total as dollar equivalent):</p>
<p>    Banks bought    $12.61 million</p>
<p>    Banks sold	$ 9.12 million</p>
<p>Total turnover  $21.73 million ($31.49 million)</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 91188</p>
</text>
